OL,3,GNEWSACare home reunites school friends
OL,4,Aafter 80 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Oxfordshire has brought
OL,7,Ftogether two primary school friends
OL,8,Fafter 80 years.
OL,10,FUntil July of this year, Brian Busby,
OL,11,F89, was the only man living at
OL,12,FLyndhurst care home in Goring. The
OL,13,Fformer soldier moved into the home four
OL,14,Fyears ago.
OL,16,FWhen David Minchin, 90, arrived, he
OL,17,Finstantly recognised Busby, despite not
OL,18,Fhaving seen him since they were 10
OL,19,Fyears old.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
