OL,3,GNEWSACare home reunites school friends
OL,4,Aafter 80 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair attended Goring Primary school
OL,7,Fon Wallingford Road, and although they
OL,8,Fwere not close friends, they have now
OL,9,Fbecome good pals and enjoy a daily pint
OL,10,Fof Guinness together.
